														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4839080">
									

<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> No</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Genre (Optional):</strong> Weird/Horror SCP.</p>
<p><strong>Page Layout (Optional):</strong> Standard SCP with multiple Incident Reports and connections to VII SCP's (for others or maybe for me to write).</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> A Dishwasher that has tongues clean dishes within the SCP, if a human with a slightly above average IQ comes near the SCP they become hysterical, denying that the SCP is anomalous at all and inserts themselves into the SCP.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> This is suppose to be a weird SCP that has been Neutralized under the 05 command despite pleading from the Ethics committee. I make it a point that the Ethics committee points out that The SCP Foundation is <strong>not</strong> The DDD (Destroy, Destroy, Destroy) Foundation. The overall narrative is that the 05 are in a position of power and could abuse their power whenever and however they want. I'm hoping to make this multiple connections between SCP's.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> The hook is more about how &quot;unstable&quot; the SCP is. Most foundation members (are assumed) to have a high IQ. This SCP doesn't allow high IQ's around it. The SCP is somewhat of a threat to the 05 command and is neutralized for that reason.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> I'm not anywhere near greenlights for the SCP. This was a very rough draft and if someone takes an interest in this SCP I would be glad to have someone possibly make this a joint venture. Thanks for future critiques.</p>

