														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4839075">
									

<p>Let's see what we have here.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">[+]&nbsp;Here,&nbsp;have&nbsp;some&nbsp;crit</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">[-]&nbsp;OK,&nbsp;now&nbsp;give&nbsp;me&nbsp;back&nbsp;my&nbsp;crit</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>So my concern here is that this is just 294 but with alchemy. I think this machine would be too similar to 294 to be successful on its own. You have the spark of a story with the researcher creating a potentially dangerous substance, and I would suggest to expand upon that. What did they do? What were their motivations? What are they planning to do <em>next</em>?</p>
<p>As you mention, this machine would not be dangerous on its own, so you may as well create a story around it about how people misuse it. I still think it would be too similar to 294, but if you expand the alchemy thing, this will have a little more potential. Maybe instead of a 'modern' device, it would be better to do it as an 'ancient' one?</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>Overall, I think you need to add more story to this.</p>
<p>Feel free to contact a member of the <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/butterfly-squad-roster">Butterfly Squad</a> to get more crit, or PM me to take another look.</p>

							</div>

								
					
