									</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mindlessphilosopher" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7085649); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7085649&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607370173" alt="MindlessPhilosopher" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7085649)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mindlessphilosopher" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7085649); return false;" >MindlessPhilosopher</a></span> <span class="odate time_1607364687 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">07 Dec 2020 18:11</span>
																	<br/>
						in discussion <a href="/forum/c-50742/per-page-discussions">Per Page Discussions / Per page discussions</a> &raquo;
						<a href="/experiment-log-t-98816-oc108-682/comments/show">Experiment Log T-98816-OC108/682</a>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4839053">
									

<p>And their hair-brained attempts to kill what just won't stay dead.</p>
<p>I think at this point, the Foundation's attempt to torture and mutilate 682 has caused far more harm than good, and if there was even a cell of good in him (he seemed to like that one little girl)&#8230; Well, all that's left is a whole lot of hate.</p>
<p>And yet the more hair-brained the attempt, the more fun the read.</p>
<p>I'm hoping that there will continue to be even more hair-brained entries, and when ideas using SCPs runs out-and this is my over-imagination talking, I'd love to see him thrown in with characters from other universes.</p>
<p>We all know what would happen if 682 and someone like Vegeto were to be thrown into a fight together (682 would eventually adapt and become even more powerful, with the ability to launch blasts capable of destroying the planet), but I'd just love to read a showdown where his opponent apparently has him outmatched, and just keeps pushing his buttons, along the lines of Vegeto vs. Super Buu. I think 682 would throw death threats left and right, and curse like a drunk sailor! Probably in multiple languages.</p>
<p>In the meantime, I have plenty more termination entries to read, and <a href="https://deathbattlefanon.fandom.com/wiki/Doomsday_vs._SCP-682">this gem here</a>!</p>

